    {
      "id": "nB_tip",
      "type": "canvas_note",
      "position": {
        "x": 900,
        "y": 390
      },
      "style": {
        "width": 830,
        "height": 400
      },
      "data": {
        "label": "Note",
        "id": "nB_tip",
        "params": {
          "text": "Lecture du résultat groupby :\n\n• target=0 → Iris Setosa\n• target=1 → Iris Versicolor\n• target=2 → Iris Virginica\n\nObservations attendues :\n• Setosa a des pétales beaucoup plus courts\n• Virginica a la plus grande sepal length\n• La variance intra-groupe << variance totale\n\n→ C'est exactement ce que les algorithmes\n   de classification apprennent à distinguer !",
          "bg_color": "#dcfce7",
          "text_color": "#166534"
        }
      },
      "width": 830,
      "height": 400,
      "selected": false
    },
    {
      "id": "fC",
      "type": "canvas_frame",
      "position": {
        "x": -120,
        "y": 840
      },
      "style": {
        "width": 1860,
